{"kind":"github_issue","repository":"Trae-AI/TRAE","item":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1286","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1286/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1286/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1286/events","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1286","id":3276876032,"node_id":"I_kwDONiYvnc7DUSkA","number":1286,"title":"请求trae开放右侧边栏，允许所有扩展视图（Outline、第三方 AI 插件等）自由停靠","user":{"login":"ydf0509","id":26890690,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI2ODkwNjkw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/26890690?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydf0509","html_url":"https://github.com/ydf0509","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydf0509/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydf0509/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydf0509/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydf0509/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydf0509/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydf0509/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydf0509/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydf0509/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ydf0509/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":12,"created_at":"2025-07-30T12:33:03Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T09:24:02Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"NONE","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"\n\n主题：请求开放右侧边栏，允许所有扩展视图（Outline、第三方 AI 插件等）自由停靠\n\n产品团队您好！\n\n目前 Trae 的右侧边栏仅固定为「AI 助手/Builder」单一视图，其他扩展（如 Outline、GitLens、Git Graph、第三方 AI 插件等）无论拖拽或配置都无法放入右栏，只能留在左侧或底部。\n\n强烈建议：\n1. 恢复 VS Code 原生的「视图容器可拖拽到任意边栏」机制；  \n2. 允许用户通过 settings.json 或 UI 拖拽，把 Outline、GitLens、第三方 AI 插件等固定到右侧；  \n3. 至少提供「右栏可配置」的开关，兼顾老用户习惯和新用户需求。\n\n这样既能保留 AI 主打的体验，又能让开发者按个人工作流灵活布局，提升整体效率。\n\n感谢考虑！\n\n---","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1286/reactions","total_count":8,"+1":8,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1286/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null},"comments":[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/comments/3148925232","html_url":"https://github.com/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1286#issuecomment-3148925232","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Trae-AI/TRAE/issues/1286","id":3148925232,"node_id":"IC_kwDONiYvnc67sMkw","user":{"login":"osapis","id":29504732,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjI5NTA0NzMy","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/29504732?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/osapis","html_url":"https://github.com/osapis","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osapis/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osapis/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osapis/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osapis/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osapis/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osapis/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osapis/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osapis/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/osapis/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-08-04T02:14:16Z","updated_at":"2025-08-04T02:14:16Z","body":